From 015a2c8d1603f2a57883bdad28e52f3ffc53da8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:44:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: Reaper edits on four shipped stock pages restored;
 popup.js overlays above the shell

Found by the loss audit (every line the stack changed against the old base,
checked in the merged tree). Four stock pages this image ships had been left at
upstream's text: their www/Makefile rm lines are conditional, and the end sweep
treated them as unshipped.

- Advanced_Wireless_Content.asp: three-way merge (radio-slot mask, overlay timing);
  the one conflict keeps upstream's warning colour with our Status_Active label.
- APP_Installation.asp: three-way merge; the Download Master advert stays removed
  unconditionally (upstream gates it on nodm_support || UI4).
- AiMesh_Node_RbkFirmware.asp / AiMesh_Node_RevertFirmware.asp: upstream rewrote
  both files; our one edit (extendno "reaper" -> "Reaper" in the version string)
  re-applied.
- popup.js: 40585 added two more full-screen overlays to AsusLoaderComponent at
  z-index 2000, below the Reaper shell's header; raised to the value our fix gave
  the original loader.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/APP_Installation.asp   |  9 +-
 .../router/www/Advanced_Wireless_Content.asp  | 84 +++++++++++++------
 .../router/www/AiMesh_Node_RbkFirmware.asp    |  2 +-
 .../router/www/AiMesh_Node_RevertFirmware.asp |  2 +-
 release/src/router/www/popup.js               |  4 +-
 5 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

